  "job_B3.2.10_20251003_114611": {
    "chunk_text": "DOMINICA PRIMA IN QUADRAGESIMA. Men \u00fea leofestan, her saga\u00fe Matheus se godspellere \u00fe\u00e6tte se H\u00e6lend w\u00e6re l\u00e6ded on westen, & \u00fe\u00e6t he Se costigend \u00fea eode to him, & him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gif \u00feu sie Godes sunu, cwe\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea stanas to hlafum Se H\u00e6lend him \u00fea ondswarode, & him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ne bi\u00f0 on hlafe anum mannes lif, ac of eallum \u00fe\u00e6m \u00dea genam hine se awyrgda gast & he hine l\u00e6dde on \u00fea halgan ceastre, & he hine asette ofer \u00fe\u00e6s temples H\u00e6lend him \u00fea eft ondswarode & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ne costa \u00feu \u00feinne Drihten God. \u00de\u00e6t deofol hine \u00fea genam \u00feriddan si\u00fee, and he hine l\u00e6dde upon swi\u00fee hea dune, & him \u00e6teowde eal H\u00e6lend him ondswerede & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ga \u00feu onb\u00e6cling, wi\u00feerwearda; for\u00feon \u00fee awriten is, Weor\u00fea \u00feinne Hine \u00fea forlet se costigend, and his englas him toeodan & him \u00feegnedan. Men \u00fea leofestan, cu\u00fe is \u00fe\u00e6tte hra\u00fee Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he of \u00feam fulwihtes b\u00e6\u00fee eode, \u00fea f\u00e6stte he sona, & hie sweotollice cy\u00fedon \u00fe\u00e6t se egeslica domes d\u00e6g cyme\u00fe on \u00fea tid \u00fee Godes sunu on rode galgan Ac \u00fe\u00e6t us is to ge\u00feencenne, \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m fulwihte f\u00e6stte, & eac w\u00e6s costad. Us is \u00feonne ned\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we f\u00e6ston;",
